###
GET http://localhost:5193/api/songs/47

### get all songs
GET http://localhost:5193/api/songs
Accept: application/json

### search for "api"
GET http://localhost:5193/api/songs/search?term=API
Accept: application/json

### Update song title
PUT http://localhost:5193/api/songs/47
Content-Type: application/json

"Updated API Test Song"


### Get updated song
GET http://localhost:5193/api/songs/47


### Delete song
DELETE http://localhost:5193/api/songs/47

### Get all artists
GET http://localhost:5193/api/tables/Artist
Accept: application/json

###

### Create artist
POST http://localhost:5193/api/tables/Artist/rows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "values": {
    "Name": "API Test Artist"
  }
}

###

